WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.680
<v Latha Rao>Quick one today, just housekeeping.</v>

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.900
<v Mani Selvam>Morning. What's up.</v>

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.680
<v Latha Rao>Can we push next week from the Tuesday to the Thursday, same time? Ravi's out Tuesday.</v>

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.680
<v Mani Selvam>Thursday's fine. Send the invite over and I'll accept it.</v>

5
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.680
<v Latha Rao>Will do. Also the mockups slipped a day, so we'll look at those next time.</v>

6
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.680
<v Mani Selvam>No problem, nothing urgent my end this week.</v>

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.680
<v Latha Rao>How was the expo Friday?</v>

8
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.680
<v Mani Selvam>Long, but good. Decent turnout. Ran into a few people.</v>

9
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.680
<v Latha Rao>Nice. Nothing needed from you before Thursday, just accept the invite.</v>

10
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.400
<v Mani Selvam>Will do. Talk Thursday.</v>
